			"parameters": {},
			"title": "Chain-link fence",
			"text": "Shared chain-link fence (structures/common): the civilian walls' fence panels, a cutout (alpha) with its rails and posts; one repeat is one panel. Based on urban_wire_fence. Roughness never drops below 0.361 (RoughnessFloor); no depth, as parallax would smear the cutout. Export: File > Export material > Godot > Godot 4 Standard into data/models/board/textures/structures/common (or tools/materials/export.py), then Reload assets in the game's Tuning panel.",
